        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>Junior Project Engineer</h3>
        <p>
            <strong>Company:</strong>
            Innovative Engineering Technology
        </p>

        <p><strong>Location:</strong> Savar, Dhaka</p>

        <p>
            Worked on electrical projects,
            maintenance and technical support.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>


<section id="skills">
    <h2 class="section-title">Professional Skills</h2>

    <div class="skills">
        <div class="skill">Electrical Maintenance</div>
        <div class="skill">Electrical Troubleshooting</div>
