            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>


<section>
    <h2 class="section-title">My CV</h2>

    <div class="card contact">

        <h3>Curriculum Vitae</h3>

        <p>
            My professional CV will be available here.
        </p>

        <a href="#" class="btn">
            Download CV
        </a>

    </div>
</section>


<section id="contact">
    <h2 class="section-title">Contact Me</h2>

    <div class="card contact">

        <p>
            <strong>Phone:</strong>
            Your Phone Number
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>Email:</strong>
            Your Email Address
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>Location:</strong>
            Dhaka, Bangladesh
        </p>

    </div>
</section>

</main>


<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Md. Abdullah Al Mamun</p>
    <p>Project Engineer (Electrical)</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
